    "parakeet": {
      "download_manager": "YappYapp pinned Hugging Face downloader; FluidAudio is forced offline and only loads verified local caches for inference",
      "license_policy": "Verify Hugging Face model-card license metadata and NVIDIA upstream terms before public distribution or model bundling.",
      "integrity": "YappYapp fetches the recursive tree and model files from fixed https://huggingface.co URLs at an exact pinned revision, never honors environment-controlled registry origins or attaches ambient Hugging Face credentials, rejects unsafe relative paths, verifies declared sizes plus LFS SHA-256 or Git blob SHA-1 for the complete selected cache, and writes an owner-only .yappyapp-integrity-v1.json manifest before activation. Recording and FluidAudio loading require that verified cache; FluidAudio networking remains disabled even when YappYapp downloads are allowed.",
